  "solution": "First equation is : 180 - 32 + 3 × 148 ÷ 37 = 88\n\nOn interchanging + and × , we get:\n\n⇒ 180 - 32 × 3 + __**148 ÷ 37**__ = 88\n\n⇒ 180 - __**32 × 3**__ + 4 = 88\n\n⇒ __**180**__ - 96 __**+ 4**__ = 88\n\n⇒ __**184 - 96 **__= 88\n\n⇒ __**88 = 88**__(True).\n\nSecond equation is : 204 ÷ 17 × 23 + 5 - 97 = 50\n\nOn interchanging + and × , we get:\n\n⇒ __**204 ÷ 17**__ + 23 × 5 - 97 = 50\n\n⇒ 12 + __**23 × 5**__ - 97 = 50\n\n⇒ __**12 + 115**__ - 97 = 50\n\n⇒ __**127 - 97**__ = 50\n\n⇒ **30 ****≠**** 50**(False) / Second equation is not correct.\n\nHence, Option 4 is correct answer.",
